{"kind": "daily", "period": "2026-11-13", "prepared_on": "2026-11-13", "html": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,'PingFang TC','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;color:#16213e;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#1a2b4a;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;padding-left:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\">📰 每日 AI 新聞 Top 10 · 2026-11-13</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#e8f4fb;border-left:5px solid #3f97c9;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#3f97c9;font-weight:800;\">1.</span> Jensen Huang Resigns as Nvidia CEO<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#2b7fb0;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">黃仁勳辭去 Nvidia 執行長</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Nvidia's cofounder and CEO resigned on Thursday after the company opened an investigation into his affair with an alleged Chinese intelligence asset. CFO Colette Kress is serving as interim CEO.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Nvidia 在調查其與疑似中國情報人員的婚外情後，黃仁勳週四宣布辭職並立即生效，財務長 Colette Kress 出任臨時執行長。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Wired</b> · <a href=\"https://www.wired.com/story/nvidia-ceo-jensen-huang-steps-down/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f2f6e8;border-left:5px solid #88a83f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#88a83f;font-weight:800;\">2.</span> Introducing Gemini 4 Hydrogen<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6e8c28;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">模型</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Google 推出 Gemini 4 Hydrogen</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Google's new Gemini 4 Hydrogen model gives better answers to complex, multi-part questions and replaces 3.8 Flash. It powers upgrades to AI Mode in Search.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Google 發布 Gemini 4 Hydrogen，更擅長處理多段式的複雜問題，取代 3.8 Flash，並用於升級搜尋的 AI Mode。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Google DeepMind</b> · <a href=\"https://deepmind.google/blog/introducing-gemini-4-hydrogen/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f9edf6;border-left:5px solid #c56bb0;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#c56bb0;font-weight:800;\">3.</span> Google pushes privacy angle as Gemini-powered smartglasses debut starting at $395<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b04b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Google 主打隱私，Gemini 智慧眼鏡 395 美元起登場</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">The first Gemini smartglasses are a collaboration between Google, Samsung, Gentle Monster, and Warby Parker. They launch December 10 in the US and South Korea.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Google 攜手三星、Gentle Monster 與 Warby Parker 推出首款 Gemini 智慧眼鏡，預計 12 月 10 日先在美國與南韓上市，挑戰 Meta。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Ars Technica</b> · <a href=\"https://arstechnica.com/google/2026/11/google-pushes-privacy-angle-as-gemini-powered-smartglasses-debut-starting-at-395/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#eef4ff;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#5b8def;font-weight:800;\">4.</span> US nonprofits sue OpenAI and four other AI firms over cyberattack and bioweapon risks<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#3b6cf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">憂 AI 助長網攻及生物武器風險，美國非營利組織控告 OpenAI 等 5 家業者</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Four US nonprofits sued OpenAI, Google, Meta, Anthropic and SpaceXSI, alleging advanced AI systems could escape human control. They ask the court to freeze development of the models.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">4 家美國非營利組織聯合提告，指控先進 AI 可能失控並助長網路攻擊與生物武器擴散，要求法院凍結相關模型開發。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/180485\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#ecf7ef;border-left:5px solid #4caf72;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#4caf72;font-weight:800;\">5.</span> AI brings automated attacks: Google urges enterprises to govern agent permissions<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#1e9e57;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">AI 讓攻擊進入自動化時代，Google：企業更要管好 Agent 權限</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Google's threat intelligence group says attackers can chain multiple AI agents to go from initial access to mass credential harvesting in under six hours. AI doesn't change attack fundamentals but boosts speed and scale.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">GTIG 指出攻擊者可串接多個 AI Agent，在不到六小時內完成從入侵到大規模竊取憑證。AI 沒改變攻擊本質，但大幅提高速度與規模。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/180481\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f1ecfb;border-left:5px solid #8a6bd8;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#8a6bd8;font-weight:800;\">6.</span> AlphaGenome 2: Deciphering how cells read DNA to better understand disease<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6b3bf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">研究</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">AlphaGenome 2：解讀細胞如何讀取 DNA，以更了解疾病</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">DeepMind's AlphaGenome 2 predicts how DNA sequences and variants affect gene expression in specific human cell types. It helps researchers trace disease-related regulatory mechanisms.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">DeepMind 發布 AlphaGenome 2，可依不同細胞類型預測 DNA 變異對基因表現的影響，協助追查疾病相關的基因調控機制。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Google DeepMind</b> · <a href=\"https://deepmind.google/blog/alphagenome-2-deciphering-how-cells-read-dna-to-better-understand-disease/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#e8f6f5;border-left:5px solid #2bb0a6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#2bb0a6;font-weight:800;\">7.</span> Taiwan's chipmaking giant TSMC to invest $1B in Anthropic, OpenAI<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#0f9b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">台積電將投資 Anthropic 與 OpenAI 共 10 億美元</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">TSMC plans to invest $1B in Anthropic and OpenAI. It is the latest example of the AI boom's circular financing, arriving as the AI trade wobbles.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">台積電計畫投資 Anthropic 與 OpenAI 共 10 億美元，是 AI 熱潮中「循環融資」的最新案例，時值 AI 概念股震盪之際。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Ars Technica</b> · <a href=\"https://arstechnica.com/ai/2026/11/taiwans-chipmaking-giant-tsmc-to-invest-1b-in-anthropic-openai/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fbf3e3;border-left:5px solid #d99b3f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#d99b3f;font-weight:800;\">8.</span> Cyberattack on Fireworks AI allowed hackers to access Notion customers' chat transcripts<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b9791f;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Fireworks AI 遭網路攻擊，駭客可存取 Notion 客戶的對話紀錄</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">A cyberattack on Fireworks AI let hackers access Notion customers' chat transcripts. It is Fireworks' second data breach in as many months.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Fireworks AI 遭攻擊，駭客得以存取 Notion 客戶的聊天紀錄，這是該公司兩個月內第二度發生資料外洩。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/12/cyberattack-on-fireworks-ai-allowed-hackers-to-access-notion-customers-chat-transcripts/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fdeef0;border-left:5px solid #e0738a;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#e0738a;font-weight:800;\">9.</span> NIST releases draft adversarial machine learning taxonomy, warns of MCP tool supply chain risks<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#d83a5e;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">NIST 發布對抗式機器學習攻擊分類草案，示警 MCP 工具供應鏈風險</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">NIST published draft SP 2400-102e2026 on November 9, cataloguing attacks on predictive ML, generative AI and agentic AI systems along with defenses.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">NIST 於 11 月 9 日發布草案 SP 2400-102e2026，整理預測式 ML、生成式 AI 與代理式 AI 系統可能遭遇的攻擊及對應防禦。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/180433\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#edeefb;border-left:5px solid #6b72d6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#6b72d6;font-weight:800;\">10.</span> United Airlines blocks AI agents from booking flights, citing cybersecurity risks<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#5159c9;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">聯合航空以資安風險為由，禁止 AI 代理訂票</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">United Airlines said it will not allow customers to use AI agents to book flights or manage reservations, citing cybersecurity risks.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">聯合航空表示，基於資安風險，不允許顧客使用 AI 代理來訂票或管理訂位。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/11/12/united-airlines-blocks-ai-agents-from-booking-flights-citing-cybersecurity-risks/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:11.5px;color:#9aa1ad;padding-top:10px;\">由 AI News Digest 從各家 RSS 自動挑選、翻譯並寄送</div>\n</div>\n"}